<title>USA: Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-S Minn fed cattle not well tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested, compared with Monday's close, USDA said.</p>
<p>On a carcass basis, steers and heifers not well tested. Steers: Select to mostly Choice 2-4 1200 lbs 2 ld 115.00 Reported sales for Tues: 100. Week to Date: 6,500</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
